      ],
      "text": "`viberaven init --agents all` writes bounded VIBERAVEN:START/END rule blocks into AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, GEMINI.md, Cursor rules, copilot instructions, and .viberaven context files, with a --dry-run preview."
    },
